{"id":"6a9e16f7c7ed4975","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-mlrandom-measure.md","title":"Martin-Löf 随机点集测度为一","display":"thm-mlrandom-measure — Martin-Löf 随机点集测度为一","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-mlrandom-measure","aliases":["43-thm-mlrandom-measure"],"display":"thm-mlrandom-measure — Martin-Löf 随机点集测度为一","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.3.2 Corollary 9.3.6，印刷179，PDF199","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-mlrandom-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-mlrandom-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mlrandom-measure — Martin-Löf 随机点集测度为一"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d602113af79aa36d\" href=\"?note=d602113af79aa36d\" title=\"43-thm-ml-universal-test\">43-thm-ml-universal-test</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.3.2 Corollary 9.3.6，印刷179，PDF199"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为下述固定的公平硬币测度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>，通用检验存在性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d602113af79aa36d\" href=\"?note=d602113af79aa36d\" title=\"43-thm-ml-universal-test\">43-thm-ml-universal-test</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上给出的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\})=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\})=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>通用检验的零集恰为全部非随机点；各层测度趋零，故其交测度0。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.2 Corollary 9.3.6，印刷179，PDF199。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-ml-universal-test","status":"resolved","id":"d602113af79aa36d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 为下述固定的公平硬币测度，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]，通用检验存在性见 [[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-ml-universal-test","status":"resolved","id":"d602113af79aa36d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 为下述固定的公平硬币测度，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]，通用检验存在性见 [[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 在 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 上给出的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度，满足 $\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\})=1.","display":true}],"bytes":1278,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-mlrandom-measure]] — Martin-Löf 随机点集测度为一"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1","0586e0fd0301d605","8e999d59227f4a28","d602113af79aa36d"]}